{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 30, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "位", "id": "位"}, {"form": "侯", "id": "侯"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "安", "id": "安"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "治", "id": "治"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "高", "id": "高"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.6346509738783368, "source": "治", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 0.9122827104766164, "source": "治", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.9339339580085977, "source": "治", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.199964782928397, "source": "樂", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.472930458741285, "source": "樂", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 3.0325462466767075, "source": "樂", "target": "惡"}, {"weight": 3.3202283191284883, "source": "樂", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 1.8931119634883424, "source": "位", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.9147632110203237, "source": "位", "target": "在"}, {"weight": 4.013375499688434, "source": "位", "target": "高"}, {"weight": 0.9223330463301177, "source": "位", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 0.7944996748202328, "source": "在", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.9147632110203237, "source": "在", "target": "高"}, {"weight": 0.7479796591853399, "source": "仁", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 0.7944996748202328, "source": "仁", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 1.7389612836610842, "source": "仁", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 1.8931119634883424, "source": "仁", "target": "高"}, {"weight": 0.9122827104766164, "source": "仁", "target": "侯"}, {"weight": 0.9122827104766164, "source": "仁", "